    - target: {fileID: 296926594756892792, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[1].Line
      value: One more thing, you will see blue sparcles on the ground...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 296926594756892792, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[2].Line
      value: These are little balls of mana that you can use to cast powerful spells
