      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 936654557741377441, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 936654557741377441, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[0].Line
      value: If you want even more money you can run to this building in the middle.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 936654557741377441, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[1].Line
      value: You hold 'Enter' to claim it and when you do you will get an additional
        $20/sec
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 936654557741377441, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[2].Line
      value: You use money to spawn troops to fight for you so the more money you
        have the more powerful you will be
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 936654557741377441, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[0].CharacterName
      value: Demo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 936654557741377441, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[1].CharacterName
      value: Demo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 936654557741377441, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[2].CharacterName
      value: Demo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 936654557741377441, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[1].DialogueDelaySeconds
      value: 0.05
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 936654557741377441, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[2].DialogueDelaySeconds
      value: 0.05
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1912453865029018878, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.size
      value: 13
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1912453865029018878, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[0].Line
      value: This is you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1912453865029018878, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[1].Line
      value: You are a soul possesing an empty suite of armor.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1912453865029018878, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[2].Line
      value: Because of this you are super weak. You can only survive 2-3 hits if
        you are lucky.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1912453865029018878, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[3].Line
      value: Not only that but you don't have any way to heal yourself.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1912453865029018878, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[4].Line
      value: Because we ran out of time to make a spell for that :D
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1912453865029018878, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[5].Line
      value: For $120 you can spawn another body by pressing '0' (the number)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1912453865029018878, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[6].Line
      value: this makes it so if the body you are controlling died, you can press
        'E' to just switch one of your other bodies!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1912453865029018878, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[7].Line
      value: (You may also press E when alive to enter free cam mode were you can
        freely look around and zoom in and out with space and shift)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1912453865029018878, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[8].Line
      value: (When in freecam mode press 'E' again to return to your character)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1912453865029018878, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[9].Line
      value: Not only that, but for each body you have on the field, you get an additional
        $3/sec
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1912453865029018878, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[10].Line
      value: While alive you may also press LShift and RShift to switch between controlling
        bodies
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1912453865029018878, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[11].Line
      value: (When you are on a map with multiple lanes and multiple things to be
        interacting with in quick sucssesion mastery of this mechanic will be crutial)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1912453865029018878, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Slides.Array.data[12].Line
      value: (on this map though you don't need to worry about this too much.)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1912453865029018878, guid: 286d34cd2e37d418da682dceb8892073, type: 3}
